            <h2 class="display-lg mt-4">
              What you'll actually say to it.
            </h2>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 body-lg text-ink-muted">
            Plain English. Claude figures out which tools, skills, and subagents to use. A sample of real day-to-day requests below, pasted verbatim from client logs.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
          {workflows.map((w, i) => (
            <figure class="col-span-12 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 py-7 border-t" style="border-color: rgba(178,182,189,0.1);">
