          <article class="card-tight"><strong>HyperFrames video pipeline.</strong> <span class="text-ink-muted body-sm">Local HTML+GSAP+Puppeteer programmatic short-form video.</span></article>
          <article class="card-tight"><strong>Salesforce-specific tooling.</strong> <span class="text-ink-muted body-sm">Only if you're in the Salesforce ecosystem.</span></article>
          <article class="card-tight"><strong>Bigdata.com financial research.</strong> <span class="text-ink-muted body-sm">Only for finance and investment workflows.</span></article>
